    "activitySummaryRule": "Activity summaries contain cumulative sitting, standing, and walking times since local midnight. Select the latest summary at or before the requested time; do not add snapshots together or use a future snapshot. Combine the selected snapshot with additionalContext.activityGoal to supply all three required time goals. Derive sitting_time_progress, standing_time_progress, and walking_time_progress by dividing accumulated time by the corresponding goal in the same units.",
